// added by tests/scenarios/run.py to td.scn, whose own trainsets were removed.
// a line of its own, away from the tracks of td.scn: 300 m level, then 3000 m down a gradient of 20 per mille,
// under an overhead wire.
// the train starts on the level, with the W4 of Gora about 40 m ahead, and runs on the timetable {{timetable}}:
// Gora 10:35 -> Dol, a W4 1500 m down the gradient (stop, leaves at 10:38) -> the signal gr_sem, 1100 m further
// down, which stays at stop. the line goes on 400 m past the signal
